        "<h2>Folk History: Legends of Gambling</h2>",
        "<p>Half Image Gallery, Shanghai, 2019</p>",
        "<p>This extibition takes the lottery game popular in southern regions during earlier times as a thread, weaving together diverse forms of artwork including installation, painting and video, which explore from multiple perspectives the psychological motivations and socio-cultural underpinnings behind human behaviours such as gambling and fruad.</p>",
